WEBVTT

00:00.080 --> 00:02.040
When you cannot be there, uncertainty

00:02.040 --> 00:02.800
follows you.

00:03.160 --> 00:05.200
Aurora brings essentials like heart rate

00:05.200 --> 00:06.200
into one view.

00:06.480 --> 00:08.840
She keeps living independently. Breathe

00:08.840 --> 00:09.960
easier with Aurora.
